《外公的单车》 Grandpa's Bicycle — asset sources and licences
================================================================

MUSIC
  Original score written for this film (score.py), rendered with the library's sampler (core/audio/sampler.py) from:
  Piano: "Salamander Grand Piano V3" by Alexander Holm, licensed under CC BY 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/)
  Samples (CC0): FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org) — nylon-string guitar; VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition
  (Versilian Studios / Sam Gossner) — clarinet, flute, oboe, violin, viola and cello sections; Versilian Community Sample
  Library (Versilian Studios) — glockenspiel.

VOICE
  None. The film has no narration or spoken dialogue; the two spoken lines appear as handwritten notes and in the .srt.

SOUND EFFECTS AND AMBIENCE
  All synthesised in code for this film (mix.py, numpy/scipy): brush and pencil on paper, page turns, the bicycle bell,
  chain, falls, steps, cloth, cicadas, sparrows, songbirds, wind, a clock, a distant train, mist. No recordings.

FONTS (SIL Open Font License 1.1, downloaded from Google Fonts by fetch_fonts.mjs into fonts/)
  Noto Serif SC — Google / Adobe (subset to the characters used): the title and the stamp
  Long Cang (龙藏体) — zihun / Google Fonts: the handwritten journal notes and the two spoken lines
  IBM Plex Mono — IBM / Mike Abbink, Bold Monday: the measured labels

PAPER, STROKES, FIGURES, PROPS, THE LANE
  All generated in code for this film (paper.py, engine.js, figures.js, props.js, lane.js, acting.js, shots.js).
  engine.js is the Watercolor Brush style's stroke engine from the Lemo-Opuscar library (MIT), extended with a flat profile
  and polygon washes. No photographs, samples or third-party artwork.
